Umbhalo uma-kufika: ['html'] yenza: { <- (
		uqobo
		buyisela: ['&'] nge: ['&amp;'],
		buyisela: ['<'] nge: ['&lt;'],
		buyisela: ['>'] nge: ['&gt;'],
		buyisela: ['"'] nge: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Uhlu okusha.

['Verbatim Syntax'] izinhlamvu ngamunye: { :inombolo :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (inombolo), Letter: letter).
}.

Okuphumayo list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list hlanganisa: ['↵']).

Okuphumayo bhala: template.

